      <VERS vnumber="10">
        <gr str="3605">All </gr>
        <gr str="1471">nations </gr>compassed me <gr str="5437">about</gr>: but in the <gr str="8034">name </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>will I <gr str="4135">destroy </gr>them. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11"> They compassed me <gr str="5437">about</gr>; <gr str="1571">yea</gr>, they compassed me <gr str="5437">about</gr>: but in the <gr str="8034">name </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>I will <gr str="4135">destroy </gr>them. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12"> They compassed me <gr str="5437">about </gr>like <gr str="1682">bees</gr>; they are <gr str="1846">quenched </gr>as the <gr str="784">fire </gr>of <gr str="6975">thorns</gr>: for in the <gr str="8034">name </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>I will <gr str="4135">destroy </gr>them. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="13"> Thou hast thrust <gr str="1760 1760">sore </gr>at me that I might <gr str="5307">fall</gr>: but the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
