      <VERS vnumber="18"> The <gr str="3050">LORD </gr>hath chastened me <gr str="3256 3256">sore</gr>: but he hath <gr str="3808">not </gr>given me <gr str="5414">over </gr>unto <gr str="4194">death</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="19">
        <gr str="6605">Open </gr>to me the <gr str="8179">gates </gr>of <gr str="6664">righteousness</gr>: I will <gr str="935">go </gr>into them, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> and </STYLE> I will <gr str="3034">praise </gr>the <gr str="3050">LORD</gr>: </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20">
