        <gr str="8179">gate </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, into which the <gr str="6662">righteous </gr>shall <gr str="935">enter</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="21"> I will <gr str="3034">praise </gr>thee: <gr str="3588">for </gr>thou hast <gr str="6030">heard </gr>me, and art <gr str="1961">become </gr>my <gr str="3444">salvation</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="22"> The <gr str="68">stone </gr>
